<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST- Brazilian year-end economic forecasts.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- Brazilian year-end economic forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are individual and consensus 1996 year-end economic forecasts collected by Reuters from the offices of eight brokerages and research firms in Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro. The year-end survey and consensus results will be updated monthly after the release of trade balance each month.</p>
<p>	  *****Brazil 1996 Year-End Forecasts*****</p>
